 had ended.GameplayRetry Card Selection: Players can now recon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T21:08:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688024","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3207970-1846018067934801","game_id":"steam-3207970","kind":"update","title":"Update Patch - Lynayly Demo","summary":"The latest Lynayly update is live!This update focuses on improving multiplayer stability, introducing better disconnect and rejoining support, and fixing several issues.MultiplayerAdded support for players disconnecting and having AI take control of their characters.Improved multiplayer Continue functionality, including Steam invitations and reclaiming characters when rejoining.Improved checkpoint restoration and map synchronization when continuing multiplayer sessions.Added a host disconnection","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T22:00:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934801","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3207970-1846018067931244","game_id":"steam-3207970","kind":"announcement","title":"Lynayly Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"Experience a real-time cooperative roguelike deckbuilder where you can team up with friends or AI companions, build powerful decks, and battle through challenging encounters.We're excited to finally share Lynayly with you and would love to hear your feedback!🎮 Play the free demo and wishlist Lynayly on Steam!💬 Join our Discord for updates, patch notes, and feedback: https://discord.gg/CDfzEKZ8hThank you for supporting Lynayly!— Joyful Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T19:47:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_ur